# Extra domains for this project's sandbox firewall (one per line; full-line comments only).
# Each line is resolved with `dig` once at container start — an unresolvable line aborts the firewall.

# Playwright browser download (`npx playwright install chromium`) for layout checks.
# These CDNs rotate IPs, so addresses resolved at startup can go stale: install soon after a restart.
cdn.playwright.dev
playwright.download.prss.microsoft.com
storage.googleapis.com

